+## invoices
+
+- `invoices.hold_invoice(invoice_id)`: put an open invoice on hold (status "on_hold", records `held_at`) and emit `invoice.held`; idempotent: an invoice already on hold is returned unchanged with no new event
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no invoice with that id
+  - `E_BAD_STATE`: invoice is not open (e.g. already paid)
